cookbook/references/kaggriculture-teacher-distills-per-slot-kl-and-per-seat-winner-ce.md:58:- `python/owl/model/kaggriculture_actor.py`: `policy_core` gains `teacher_logits` and `collect_logits`. With `collect_logits`, each policy slot's density-dtype logits are returned, masked with the replay-conditioned mask the density uses and filled with `finfo(dtype).min` outside it (`market_kind` uses the final HIRE-capacity mask). With `teacher_logits`, each slot adds `categorical_kl_from_logits(teacher, student, mask)` weighted by `unit_live` or `market_live`, placed with the log-probs' `place` scatter into `[B, 252, 12]`. `GrammarPolicyResult` gains `slot_logits` and `kl` (both `None` unless requested).
cookbook/references/kaggriculture-teacher-distills-per-slot-kl-and-per-seat-winner-ce.md:59:- `python/owl/model/kaggriculture.py`: `_policy` slices `teacher_logits` per head chunk and joins `slot_logits` and `kl`. `_actor_inputs` (the actor projection) and `_evaluation_from` (the replay `ModelEvaluation`) are extracted so the teacher paths and the oracle test share them. `forward` and `evaluate_actions` behave as before.
cookbook/references/kaggriculture-teacher-distills-per-slot-kl-and-per-seat-winner-ce.md:61:- `tests/kaggriculture/helpers.py`: the heads tests' tiny models, programs and replay cases, moved unchanged in behavior (65 heads tests pass before and after).
