221:- **Seeds:** the factory passes `seed = base_seed + rank` and `seed_stride = world_size`; the native side doesn't add the rank again. Rank `r` starts with `next_seed = base_seed + r` and stride `world_size`. Every game construction and every reset consumes one seed and advances the counter. Simultaneous resets consume seeds in ascending environment index, and construction consumes seeds before any explicit `reset()`.
